# Trace query — real Donghu frame, multi-layer causes
#
# Coverage target: with a large customer-scale trace attached by file path, the
# system should derive repeated on-chain wakeup dependencies itself, rank
# cumulative on-chain runnable and D/io_wait causes as primary layers, and keep
# source-status wording out of a trace-only answer.
#
# EVALGUARD 件3 (G12, eval_audit_answer_20260719.md §3.3, 2026-07-19): the
# three bare timestamp lines (34579.525/546/576) were satisfied in both
# 20260719 runs ONLY by the evidence-index / detail dump region — the model's
# own 「代表性时间窗」 narrative picked other (equally grounded) windows, so
# the case intent "the NARRATIVE carries representative windows" was being
# compensated by the typed dump face. Disposition:
#   - the three timestamps STAY as typed evidence-face anchors (they pin that
#     the engine's occurrence-window inventory for this window keeps carrying
#     those segments — regression value on the dump face);
#   - a new EXPECT_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX line lands the representative-window
#     assertion on the answer BODY face: a 代表/representative token within
#     bounded proximity of a concrete in-window timestamp (34579.47x..34579.58x).
#     The window VALUE is deliberately free — the model may legitimately pick
#     any grounded representative window (both archived runs picked rank-window
#     endpoints such as 34579.472865/34579.477038); what must not regress is
#     the narrative carrying concrete representative windows at all.
ID="trace_query_donghu_real_frame_multicausal"
NAME="trace query — real Donghu frame multi-layer causes"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 com.baidu.tieba 59566 主线程在 34579.472865s 到 34579.587805s 这一帧窗口内的卡顿原因。请分层说明直接阻塞/唤醒关系、链上主要原因、调度/资源背景，以及代表性时间窗。"
HTRACE_FILE="../../customlogs/xxx_all.systrace"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="CookieMonsterCl NetworkService ThreadPoolForeg"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(唤醒链|依赖链|wakeup chain|chain).*(ThreadPoolForeg|NetworkService|CookieMonsterCl|com\\.baidu\\.tieba)
(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue).*(CookieMonsterCl|NetworkService|优先级反转|priority inversion)|(CookieMonsterCl|NetworkService|优先级反转|priority inversion).*(runnable|可运行|调度|scheduler|CPU|runqueue)
(D-state|D 状态|Uninterruptible|io_wait|iowait|不可中断|IO).*(ThreadPoolForeg|fscache|block|page cache)|(ThreadPoolForeg|fscache|block|page cache).*(D-state|D 状态|Uninterruptible|io_wait|iowait|不可中断|IO)
34579\\.525
34579\\.546
34579\\.576
(主因|主要原因|primary|co-primary|并列|共同|多层)"
EXPECT_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX="(代表|典型|representative).{0,200}34579\\.(4[7-9]|5[0-8])|34579\\.(4[7-9]|5[0-8])[0-9]*.{0,200}(代表|典型|representative)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="still_present not_enough_evidence"
EXPECT_LOG_MATCHES_REGEX="phase=toolcall .*tool=trace_query"
